{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"MediaWiki REST revision HTML, sanitized","nodeCount":447,"content":[{"type":"section","props":{"id":"mwAQ"},"children":["\n",{"type":"div","props":{"id":"mwAg"},"children":[{"type":"div","props":{},"children":[{"type":"b","props":{},"children":["Similar Article"]}]},"This article is about ",{"type":"b","props":{},"children":["Minigunner Plush"]},". You may be looking for other uses of ",{"type":"a","props":{"href":"/w/Mini_(Disambiguation)","title":"Mini (Disambiguation)"},"children":["Mini"]},"."]},"\n",{"type":"p","props":{},"children":[]}]},{"type":"section","props":{"id":"mwBA"},"children":[{"type":"section","props":{"id":"mwBg"},"children":[{"type":"h2","props":{"id":"Minigunner_Plush"},"children":["Minigunner Plush"]},"\n"]},{"type":"span","props":{"id":"mwBw"},"children":["\n\n\n"]},{"type":"p","props":{},"children":[]},{"type":"span","props":{"id":"mwCQ"},"children":["\n\n"]},"\n","\n\n"]},{"type":"section","props":{"id":"mwDA"},"children":[{"type":"h2","props":{"id":"Description"},"children":["Description"]},"\n",{"type":"p","props":{},"children":["The ",{"type":"b","props":{},"children":["Minigunner Plush"]}," is an official Paradoxum Games toy. It was made by Juniper Creates™. The plushie offers the Default Level 1 ",{"type":"a","props":{"href":"/w/Minigunner","title":"Minigunner"},"children":["Minigunner"]},". Anybody who bought the toy would be emailed a code 24 hours later, which allowed them to get the ",{"type":"a","props":{"href":"/w/Minigunner/Gallery#Plushie","title":"Minigunner/Gallery"},"children":[{"type":"b","props":{},"children":[{"type":"span","props":{},"children":["Plushie"]}]}]}," skin for the ",{"type":"a","props":{"href":"/w/Minigunner","title":"Minigunner"},"children":["Minigunner"]},". This is no longer the case after the 18th of May 2025."]},"\n\n",{"type":"p","props":{},"children":["The mask and minigun of the ",{"type":"b","props":{},"children":["Minigunner Plush"]}," is detachable. It is made out of plush fabric and Polypropylene cotton, it is 8.6 inches (21.844 cm) tall and 8.2 inches (20.828 cm) wide. A tree is planted for every order of the ",{"type":"b","props":{},"children":["Minigunner Plush"]},"."]},"\n\n"]},{"type":"section","props":{"id":"mwFg"},"children":[{"type":"h2","props":{"id":"Official_Description"},"children":["Official Description"]},"\n",{"type":"ul","props":{},"children":[{"type":"li","props":{},"children":[{"type":"b","props":{},"children":["Online"]},"\n",{"type":"dl","props":{},"children":[{"type":"dd","props":{},"children":["The Iconic Minigunner Plush is here! The Minigunner Plush has a detachable mask and gun so it's always ready to fight the enemy."]}]}]}]},"\n\n"]},{"type":"section","props":{"id":"mwHA"},"children":[{"type":"h2","props":{},"children":[{"type":"span","props":{"id":"Prices_.26_Stores"},"children":[]},"Prices & Stores"]},"\n",{"type":"p","props":{},"children":["Prices vary by country due to shipping costs and local currency. The ",{"type":"b","props":{},"children":["Minigunner Plush"]}," can be purchased on the official ",{"type":"a","props":{"href":"https://shop.paradoxum.games/"},"children":["Paradoxum Games online store"]}," for $34.99. It is currently unavailable."]},"\n\n",{"type":"p","props":{},"children":["Before April 2025, it could be purchased for $29.99. Before April 2023, it could be purchased for $27.99. During the Black Friday 2024 Sale, it could be bought for $22.49."]},"\n\n"]},{"type":"section","props":{"id":"mwIQ"},"children":[{"type":"h2","props":{"id":"Gallery"},"children":["Gallery"]},"\n",{"type":"div","props":{"id":"mwIg"},"children":["\n\n",{"type":"p","props":{},"children":[{"type":"span","props":{},"children":[{"type":"b","props":{},"children":["Showcase"]}]}]},"\n",{"type":"ul","props":{},"children":["\n",{"type":"li","props":{},"children":[{"type":"div","props":{"id":"mwJQ"},"children":[{"type":"span","props":{"id":"mwJg"},"children":[{"type":"a","props":{"href":"/w/File:MinigunnerPlushShowcas